Drizzle schema lives in the db package. After editing it, run `{{runScript "db:generate"}}` to write a SQL migration and `{{runScript "db:migrate"}}` to apply it. Inspect data with `{{runScript "db:studio"}}`.

`{{runScript "db:push"}}` syncs the schema without a migration file. drizzle-kit asks for confirmation, so run it from a terminal; `{{packageRunner}} drizzle-kit push --force` skips the prompt for scripts (a package manager only forwards script flags after `--`, and not the same way everywhere).
